  array([[1.-1.j, 4.-4.j],
         [2.-2.j, 5.-5.j],
         [3.-3.j, 6.-6.j]])>

  'perm' is more useful for n-dimensional tensors where n > 2:

  >>> x = tf.constant([[[ 1,  2,  3],
  ...                   [ 4,  5,  6]],
  ...                  [[ 7,  8,  9],
