  <tf.Tensor: shape=(2, 3, 2), dtype=int32, numpy=
  array([[[ 1,  4],
          [ 2,  5],
          [ 3,  6]],
          [[ 7, 10],
          [ 8, 11],
          [ 9, 12]]], dtype=int32)>

  Note: This has a shorthand `linalg.matrix_transpose`):

